e only one of its kind in Korea(medicine-bio jobs camp) \r\n* The largest in Chungboo - region Dankook University Hospital, Dankook University dental hospital. Dental college Jukjeon dental hospital\r\n* College of Pharmacy, completion ofan advanced pharmacy hall'": 2,
